{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"BIT-mysql-client-2026-85985","published":"2026-10-21T08:56:39.215Z","modified":"2026-10-21T12:10:47.332548030Z","aliases":["BIT-mariadb-2026-85985","BIT-mariadb-min-2026-85985","CVE-2026-85985","GHSA-2245-9hm3-wxf6"],"summary":"MariaDB: Unauthorized file access via CONNECT engine UDFs","details":"MariaDB server is a community developed fork of MySQL server. From 10.6.1 until 10.6.28, 10.11.19, 11.4.13, 11.8.9, 12.3.3, and 13.0.2, the CONNECT engine plugin file-access UDFs json_file(), bson_file(), jfile_make(), bfile_make(), and jbin_file() are affected because each does not enforce FILE privilege or the secure_file_priv setting. A low-privileged attacker can trigger the issue by calling a CONNECT file-access UDF with a filesystem path, then invoke a CONNECT file-access UDF to access a filesystem path and read or write files that the database account is not authorized to access, subject to operating-system permissions. This issue is fixed in versions 10.6.28, 10.11.19, 11.4.13, 11.8.9, 12.3.3, and 13.0.2.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"mysql-client","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/mysql-client"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"10.6.1"},{"fixed":"10.6.28"},{"introduced":"10.11.1"},{"fixed":"10.11.19"},{"introduced":"11.4.1"},{"fixed":"11.4.13"},{"introduced":"11.8.1"},{"fixed":"11.8.9"},{"introduced":"12.3.1"},{"fixed":"12.3.3"},{"introduced":"13.0.1"},{"fixed":"13.0.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/mysql-client/BIT-mysql-client-2026-85985.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N"}]}],"references":[{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/4f66ca1b69daf1b7e6a562ca8e86d77a6a70abfe"},{"type":"ARTICLE","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-10.11.19"},{"type":"ARTICLE","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-10.6.28"},{"type":"ARTICLE","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-11.4.13"},{"type":"ARTICLE","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-11.8.9"},{"type":"ARTICLE","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-12.3.3"},{"type":"ARTICLE","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-13.0.2"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/MariaDB/server/security/advisories/GHSA-2245-9hm3-wxf6"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-40323"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-85985"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:mariadb:mariadb:*:*:*:*:*:*:*:*"],"severity":"Medium"}}